  (text "ADS1115 module (0x48): A0-A1 differential = shunt (current, +-256 mV range, 0.8 mA per bit), A2-A3 differential = cell voltage / 2 (Kelvin, +-2.048 V range)."
    (at 25 178.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 78a4ae0b-0066-4eed-b6b7-24dae8ac0fe0))
  (text "R503/R504 set the voltage accuracy. With 1 % parts, calibrate once against a DMM (two points) and store the gain in firmware."
    (at 25 182.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 9214b78d-741f-4623-8630-cf257ed93dc4))
  (text "Four NTCs (10k, 10k pull-up to +3V3) go to the MCU ADC (PA2-PA5): cell surface, pocket air, load heatsink, Peltier hot side. NTC_HS and NTC_CELL also feed the OT comparators."
    (at 25 187.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 111793e5-58ff-4da1-9b48-eb6461d9b3d3))
  (text "V_FAST: buffered cell voltage / 2 for the MCU ADC (PA1), for the fast voltage step at a current edge (R500). It is ground-referenced: subtract I x 10 mOhm in firmware."
    (at 25 191.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid d56ee30f-6ca7-4f5c-bcef-15b400ea765c))
